Running the Code
-------------------------
running in mininet (several hosts):
(1) Open a shell in your Ubuntu VM, invoke code below:
sudo mn -c
sudo mn --topo=single,8 --link=tc,delay=10ms -x
(2) In h1, invoke "python3 server.py"
(4) In other hosts, invoke "python3 client.py -a 10.0.0.1", enter your username, then send message




serialize setting(if needed):
flatc --python schema.fbs
